orthern region","kjv":"Magog.","count":4},"H4032":{"lemma":"מָגוֹר","xlit":"mâgôwr","pron":"maw-gore'","from":"or (Lamentations 2:22) מָגוּר; from H1481 (גּוּר) in the sense of fearing;","def":"a fright (objective or subjective)","kjv":"fear, terror. Compare H4036 (מָגוֹר מִסָּבִיב).","count":8},"H4033":{"lemma":"מָגוּר","xlit":"mâgûwr","pron":"maw-goor'","from":"or מָגֻר; from H1481 (גּוּר) in the sense of lodging;","def":"a temporary abode; by extension, a permanent residence","kjv":"dwelling, pilgrimage, where sojourn, be a stranger. Compare H4032 (מָגוֹר).","count":11},"H4034":{"lemma":"מְגוֹרַה","xlit":"mᵉgôwrah","pron":"meg-o-raw'","from":"feminine of H4032 (מָגוֹר);","def":"affright","kjv":"fear.","count":2},"H4035":{"lemma":"מְגוּרָה","xlit":"mᵉgûwrâh","pron":"meg-oo-raw'","from":"feminine of H4032 (מָגוֹר) or of H4033 (מָגוּר);","def":"a fright; also a granary","kjv":"barn, fear.","count":2},"H4036":{"lemma":"מָגוֹר מִסָּבִיב","xlit":"Mâgôwr miç-Çâbîyb","pron":"maw-gore' mis-saw-beeb'","from":"from H4032 (מָגוֹר) and H5439 (סָבִיב) with the preposition inserted; affright from around;","def":"Magor-mis-Sabib, a symbolic name of Pashur","kjv":"Magormissabib.","count":2},"H4037":{"lemma":"מַגְזֵרָה","xlit":"magzêrâh","pron":"mag-zay-raw'","from":"from H1504 (גָּזַר);","def":"a cutting implement, i.e. a blade","kjv":"axe.","count":1},"H4038":{"lemma":"מַגָּל","xlit":"maggâl","pron":"mag-gawl'","from":"from an unused root meaning to reap;","def":"a sickle","kjv":"sickle.","count":2},"H4039":{"lemma":"מְגִלָּה","xlit":"mᵉgillâh","pron":"meg-il-law'","from":"from H1556 (גָּלַל);","def":"a roll","kjv":"roll, volume.","count":21},"H4040":{"lemma":"מְגִלָּה","xlit":"mᵉgillâh","pron":"meg-il-law'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H4039 (מְגִלָּה)","def":"{a roll}","kjv":"roll.","count":1},"H4041":{"lemma":"מְגַמָּה","xlit":"mᵉgammâh","pron":"meg-am-maw'","from":"from the same as H1571 (גַּם);","def":"properly, accumulation, i.e. impulse or direction","kjv":"sup up.","count":1},"H4042":{"lemma":"מָגַן","xlit":"mâgan","pron":"maw-gan'","from":"a denominative from H4043 (מָגֵן);","def":"properly, to shield; encompass with; figuratively, to rescue, to hand safely over (i.e. surrender)","kjv":"deliver.","count":3},"H4043":{"lemma":"מָגֵן","xlit":"mâgên","pron":"maw-gane'","from":"also (in plural) feminine מְגִנָּה; from H1598 (גָּנַן);","def":"a shield (i.e. the small one or buckler); figuratively, a protector; also the scaly hide of the crocodile","kjv":"[idiom] armed, buckler, defence, ruler, [phrase] scale, shield.","count":63},"H4044":{"lemma":"מְגִנָּה","xlit":"mᵉginnâh","pron":"meg-in-naw'","from":"from H4042 (מָגַן);","def":"a covering (in a bad sense), i.e. blindness or obduracy","kjv":"sorrow. See also H4043 (מָגֵן).","count":1},"H4045":{"lemma":"מִגְעֶרֶת","xlit":"migʻereth","pron":"mig-eh'-reth","from":"from H1605 (גָּעַר);","def":"reproof (i.e. curse)","kjv":"rebuke.","count":1},"H4046":{"lemma":"מַגֵּפָה","xlit":"maggêphâh","pron":"mag-gay-faw'","from":"from H5062 (נָגַף);","def":"a pestilence; by analogy, defeat","kjv":"([idiom] be) plague(-d), slaughter, stroke.","count":26},"H4047":{"lemma":"מַגְפִּיעָשׁ","xlit":"Magpîyʻâsh","pron":"mag-pee-awsh'","from":"apparently from H1479 (גּוּף) or H5062 (נָגַף) and H6211 (עָשׁ); exterminator of (the) moth;","def":"Magpiash, an Israelite","kjv":"Magpiash.","count":1},"H4048":{"lemma":"מָגַר","xlit":"mâgar","pron":"maw-gar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to yield up; intensively, to precipitate","kjv":"cast down, terror.","count":2},"H4049":{"lemma":"מְגַר","xlit":"mᵉgar","pron":"meg-ar'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H4048 (מָגַר);","def":"to overthrow","kjv":"destroy.","count":1},"H4050":{"lemma":"מְגֵרָה","xlit":"mᵉgêrâh","pron":"meg-ay-raw'","from":"from H1641 (גָּרַר);","def":"a saw","kjv":"axe, saw.","count":4},"H4051":{"lemma":"מִגְרוֹן","xlit":"Migrôwn","pron":"mig-rone'","from":"from H4048 (מָגַר); precipice;","def":"Migron, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Migron